---
layout: layouts/base.njk
fullTitle: "Manual Play ➣ Human-powered music discovery"
socialTitle: "Manual Play: Human-powered music discovery"
ownHeader: true
---
<main class="flex-1 pt-16 pb-20 sm:pt-24">
  <header class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
      {% set discSize = 96 %}{% set discClass = "size-24 rounded-[22px]" %}
      {% include "spin-disc.njk" %}

      {% include "nav-links.njk" %}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-2xl leading-snug font-light text-pretty sm:text-3xl">
      <h1>{% wordmark %} is a reader for new music.</h1>
      <p>Subscribe to the blogs, websites, and newsletters you trust, and {% wordmark %} turns their posts into a feed of releases that you can play with a single tap.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8">
      {% include "app-store-badge.njk" %}
    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="features" class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-5xl px-6 sm:mt-20" aria-label="Features">
    {% include "features-grid.njk" %}
  </section>

  <section class="mt-16 sm:mt-20" aria-label="Screenshots">
    {% include "screenshots-carousel.njk" %}
  </section>

  {#- A note from the developer, set like a letter: the photo, the greeting, then the note in one column. The photo is
      the one in the app's welcome screen, by Steve Sym. #}
  <section id="about" class="mt-16 bg-shade py-16 sm:mt-24 sm:py-20" aria-label="About the developer">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/90">
        <img
          src="/images/spencer.jpg"
          width="1080"
          height="720"
          alt="Spencer playing drums on stage"
          loading="lazy"
          class="mb-10 w-full max-w-lg rounded-2xl"
        >
        <p class="text-2xl leading-snug font-light text-ink sm:text-3xl">
          Hi, I’m <a href="https://spencertweedy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-amber-400 decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-ink">Spencer</a>.
        </p>
        <p>I created {% wordmark %} because I wanted a more focused, fun, and humane way to discover new music. Streaming services are convenient, but they’re also bloated, and I hate the power they have over what we do and don’t hear.</p>
        <p>Luckily, the open web is alive. And music journalists&#8288;—people whose lives are built around listening to and contemplating music—are still publishing.</p>
        <p>{% wordmark %} is an effort to bring some attention back to the ecosystem of real people who write about music, with all the convenience of a streaming app.</p>
        <p>It’s not a direct attack on Goliath, but a side door into his house, so we can enjoy the things he hid in the cellar.</p>
        <p>I hope you find some music you love.</p>
        <p>—Spencer</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-5xl px-6 sm:mt-20">
    <p class="max-w-2xl text-2xl leading-snug font-light text-pretty sm:text-3xl">
      {% wordmark %} is free and donation-supported.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-5">
      {% include "app-store-badge.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

